The '''Mossy Loot Crate''' is a lootable container variant that spawns in the [[Mossy Forest]] biome of ''[[Human Host]]''.

== Loot rate sets ==

Every crate in this biome pulls from one of the rate sets below. The ''Spawn rate'' column is the probability that a category yields an item when the crate rolls; the ''Stack factor'' scales the stack size for stackable categories.

=== Food_Loot ===

{| class="wikitable sortable" style="font-size:0.9em;"
! Category !! Spawn rate !! Stack factor
|-
| Food <small>(食物)</small> || 10% || 1
|-
| Water <small>(水)</small> || 10% || 1
|-
| Spoiled food <small>(腐败食物)</small> || 2% || 1
|}
